1. Agents_Failure_Attribution (Who&When)
   https://github.com/mingyin1/Agents_Failure_Attribution

   The inference and error-template-generation scripts under `src/` are
   adapted from this repository. We retain the structure of the upstream
   pipeline (trajectory parsing, similarity-based template retrieval,
   all-at-once / step-by-step / binary-search detection methods) and
   extend it with CORRECT's schema-guided detection.

   Cite the upstream Who&When work:
     Zhang, S., Yin, M., Zhang, J., Liu, J., Han, Z., Zhang, J., Li, B.,
     Wang, C., Wang, H., Chen, Y., and Wu, Q. (2025).
     "Which Agent Causes Task Failures and When? On Automated Failure
     Attribution of LLM Multi-Agent Systems." ICML 2025.

