2. Magentic-One
   https://github.com/microsoft/autogen (Magentic-One agent system)
   Microsoft Research

   The multi-agent trajectories distributed as part of the CORRECT-Error
   benchmark were generated by running Magentic-One on standard benchmark
   tasks (GAIA, HotpotQA, Musique, WikiMQA, ARC, Math500, MMLU-Pro).
   Magentic-One is released under the MIT License.

   Cite Magentic-One:
     Fourney, A., Bansal, G., Mozannar, H., Tan, C., Salinas, E., Niedtner,
     F., Proebsting, G., Bassman, G., Gerrits, J., Alber, J., et al. (2024).
     "Magentic-One: A Generalist Multi-Agent System for Solving Complex
     Tasks." arXiv:2411.04468.

